  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Sourdough Bread",
  "description": "This sourdough bread recipe makes a spectacular sourdough loaf in your own kitchen with a homemade sourdough starter and a minimal amount of work.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-09-26T02:23:25-04:00",
